OL,3,GNEWSADual carriageway reopens after
OL,4,Awildfire repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dual carriageway that was closed for
OL,7,Fnearly two weeks due to a wildfire in
OL,8,Fthe New Forest National Park has
OL,9,Freopened.
OL,11,FA major incident was declared after a
OL,12,Fvan fire on the A31 near Ringwood on 9
OL,13,FAugust went on to destroy about 0.6 sq
OL,14,Fmiles (1.6 sq km) of heathland.
OL,16,FNational Highways said the road, which
OL,17,Fis the main route between Bournemouth
OL,18,Fand Southampton, reopened on Saturday
OL,19,Fmorning following repairs.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
